{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Without wood</b> [באפס פחם] — באפס is like באין [\"when there is no\"]." "<b>Will be silent</b> [ישתוק] — the Targum [of] מחריש [is] שתיק, that is, ישתוק איש מדון [\"a man will be silent from dispute\"]."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:54.792273838Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}